WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.267
-Nicholas, thank you
for being here on the show.

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:04.300
I appreciate it.
-Great to be here.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.634
This is so exciting, man.

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:07.834
-No -- It is. I am --
-I've been a fan for so long.

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:09.367
So this is --
Yeah, this is awesome.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:11.901
-We've actually --
We've met before once.

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:14.968
Do you remember that?
-Yeah, I do. I do. Um...

00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:17.234
Kind of a weird dinner, right?
Kind of a weird crew.

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:19.000
-It was a little odd, right?
-Yeah, it was a little odd.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.534
-What was that again?
-It was very intimate.

00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:24.334
It was, like, Senator John Kerry

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:29.234
and some, like, bank CEOs,
Goldman Sachs backing CEO.

00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:31.067
-Sounds like my crowd
I roll with.

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:32.300
-Yeah, me too. Yeah.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.901
Big financial
kind of contingent.

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.501
-Yeah.
-We were all solo.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:37.400
It was -- Nobody had a plus one.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.067
So it was kind of like
a meet-and-greet.

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:40.567
-Seems like "Squid Game."

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:42.234
-[ Laughter ]
-What was it?

00:00:42.234 --> 00:00:44.200
-I don't know.
-Yeah, it was odd.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.734
-Yeah. We were at opposite ends
of the table.

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:48.634
And I was like, "I got to talk
to Jimmy, but I don't know how."

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:50.434
'Cause do I ask, like,

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:52.300
you know, Gayle King to stand up

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.467
so that I can move her
and sit next to you?

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:55.934
-Yeah.
Gayle King was there, as well.

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.501
-Yeah, Gayle --
Arianna Huffington.

00:00:57.501 --> 00:01:00.601
We're just going to name drop --
We're just going to drop names.

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:03.200
-Was J.J. Watt there?
-J.J. Watt was there. Exactly.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.534
-What's your small talk?

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:08.234
What's your go-to
when we're at these dinners?

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.267
-You know, banks. Banks are --

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:12.834
-That's not true.
-Banks are big, you know?

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:15.000
-I know, but we weren't talking
about banks, were we?

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.868
-No, no. I guess -
-I have no idea about banks.

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:21.868
-I don't know -- Yeah. I have
a Bank of America account.

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:24.634
-You can't point to the crowd
like they're going to clap.

00:01:24.634 --> 00:01:26.367
You think that
they're going to clap?

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:29.734
"Hey, well,
I do have an ATM card.

00:01:29.734 --> 00:01:31.334
What's up? You guys know
what I'm talking about?

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:32.634
No big deal."
-[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:34.934
-"Citibank, boo!"
-Oh, my God.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:36.734
-"Bank of America, yeah!"

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:39.968
-Oh, my -- That is ridiculous.
-Banks are sick.

00:01:39.968 --> 00:01:42.367
-Anyways, I'm glad
you're finally on the show.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:43.667
-Me too.
-You look sharp, buddy.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:46.067
I want to talk about
"Succession."

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:48.367
You -- Cousin Greg, just --

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:51.634
I mean, honestly every scene
that you're in, you steal.

00:01:51.634 --> 00:01:52.934
You don't have to react to that.

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:55.334
You already have one Emmy
nomination under your belt.

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:56.567
-That's really nice. Thank you.

00:01:56.567 --> 00:01:58.501
-And I'm sure
you're gonna have much more.

00:01:58.501 --> 00:02:01.734
Do people try to hit you up
for spoilers?

00:02:01.734 --> 00:02:03.334
Not like I'm doing that tonight,
but...

00:02:03.334 --> 00:02:05.000
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
People want spoilers.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.801
-Yeah. Not me.
-You're good?

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:09.501
-If you feel like
telling me something...

00:02:09.501 --> 00:02:11.133
I mean, is it about
banking or whatever?

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:13.167
Whatever you feel
like telling me, I'm down.

00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:14.934
I mean, who is
the most famous person

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.734
that tried to hit you up
for spoilers?

00:02:16.734 --> 00:02:21.367
-You know, I -- Bradley Cooper.

00:02:21.367 --> 00:02:23.100
-What?
-Bradley Cooper...

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:25.300
-Yeah.
-...is a big "Succession" fan.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:28.133
And I didn't know it.
I was invited to his house.

00:02:28.133 --> 00:02:30.300
Jeremy Strong and him
have become buddies.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:33.534
And, so, I was invited over
to watch some football.

00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:35.300
Not a big football guy,
but I was like,

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.267
"This is awesome.
I love Bradley Cooper."

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:40.334
Huge, like, idol of mine.

00:02:40.334 --> 00:02:44.067
And so I went over,
and he has so many theories.

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:45.701
He was like,
"What -- Like, when Shiv,

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:47.434
like, looked this way,
what did that mean?

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:49.033
Like, I think
it meant this or that."

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:50.467
-And he's a charmer,
Bradley Cooper.

00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:51.467
-Absolutely.

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:52.667
-So I would just
tell him everything.

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:54.100
-Yeah. He's --

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.767
-I'd say,
"Here's the ending, dude.

00:02:55.767 --> 00:02:57.934
Leave me alone, man."
-Totally.

00:02:57.934 --> 00:03:00.100
-"Get that icy stare
away from me, yeah."

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.133
-He's so handsome.
-He's a handsome dude. Yeah.

00:03:02.133 --> 00:03:04.434
-He gets really close when
he talks to you, too, right?

00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:07.167
-Yeah -- No.
Does he get close to you?

00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:08.434
He got close to you?

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:10.400
-Yeah, yeah.
I got close, too, and...

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.033
-Yeah, but I didn't --
-We were both moving closer.

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:16.033
-Questlove said that --
Questlove has a theory.

00:03:16.033 --> 00:03:17.634
He said, "I'm calling it now.

00:03:17.634 --> 00:03:20.200
"Cousin Greg is opps.
It's a sting all along."

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.133
He thinks that you're an agent.

00:03:22.133 --> 00:03:24.434
[ Audience murmurs ]

00:03:24.434 --> 00:03:28.300
-Like a narc?
-Oh, yeah.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:31.067
-Like an inside man?

00:03:31.067 --> 00:03:32.767
-Absolutely.

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:35.133
-For the government?

00:03:35.133 --> 00:03:37.167
-Yeah.

00:03:37.167 --> 00:03:39.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.234
-There you go.
-Could be right.

00:03:42.234 --> 00:03:43.634
Could be right. Could be right.

00:03:43.634 --> 00:03:45.167
-That could be right?
-That could be.

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:47.133
It could be.
-I know I'm right.

00:03:47.133 --> 00:03:49.534
I'm calling it. Season six.

00:03:49.534 --> 00:03:51.968
-I'm not nodding yes or no.

00:03:51.968 --> 00:03:55.367
-We're going to play this
interview back after season six,

00:03:55.367 --> 00:03:57.434
and we'll see how -- Yeah.

00:03:57.434 --> 00:03:58.934
-I can't tell
what I revealed just now.

00:03:58.934 --> 00:04:00.267
Did I reveal -- Yeah.

00:04:00.267 --> 00:04:01.701
-But this is what
a great actor he is.

00:04:01.701 --> 00:04:03.934
He knows exactly who he is

00:04:03.934 --> 00:04:06.100
and he's acting like
he doesn't even know who he is.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.167
Nicholas Braun!
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:04:09.167 --> 00:04:11.734
Here's Nicholas Braun
in "Succession."

00:04:11.734 --> 00:04:14.334
He's great. Watch this.

00:04:14.334 --> 00:04:16.400
-It's not my preferred choice.
-Or mine.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.567
I -- I thought, you know,
you said you'd never burn me.

00:04:19.567 --> 00:04:22.200
-I said I'd try not to burn you.
-Well, no.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.601
You said -- On the plane,
you said --

00:04:23.601 --> 00:04:25.400
-Hey, hey. Hey, hey.
Let's not "he said, she said."

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:28.133
There's a lot of [bleep] said.

00:04:28.133 --> 00:04:31.601
Look. I'm still not saying
I will burn you.

00:04:31.601 --> 00:04:34.167
All I'm saying
is I might burn you.

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:35.467
It's a margin call.

00:04:35.467 --> 00:04:38.234
-And just how bad
will the burning be?

00:04:38.234 --> 00:04:41.934
I mean, even as I ask that,
I can tell it's not gonna be...

00:04:44.167 --> 00:04:47.167
-Ha! Nicholas Braun, everybody!

00:04:47.167 --> 00:04:51.133
"Succession" airs
Sundays at 9:00 p.m. on HBO.

